rates a clear progression from general sadness about separation to expressing specific fear and anxiety about her future circumstances ("I don't want to be a single mom"). Therefore, Speaker 2 experienced an emotional shift.\n\n**Revisiting Choices:**\nA) second speaker\nB) none of the speakers\nC) first speaker\nD) both speakers\n\nBased on the analysis, the second speaker shows the most discernible emotional shift.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{A}$
