ssive follow-up, reinforces the idea that the initial excitement was not real.\n\n**Conclusion:** The sarcasm likely stems from the contrast between the stated excitement and the underlying reality or the subsequent subdued response, suggesting the excitement was not genuine.\n\nAnswer: \boxed{D}
